graph TB
    Start([CLI Entry: stdn command]) --> ConfigLoad[Load Configuration<br/>config.json discovery]
    ConfigLoad --> TechLoad[Load Technology List<br/>from CSV]
    
    TechLoad --> Stage1{Stage 1:<br/>Component Extraction}
    
    Stage1 --> CompAgent[Component Extraction Agent<br/>Role-based prompting<br/>Returns ComponentList]
    
    CompAgent --> CompCheck{Confidence<br/>> 0.85?}
    
    CompCheck -->|Yes| Stage2
    CompCheck -->|No or<br/>ENABLE_DEBATE=true| CompDebate[Component Debate Protocol]
    
    CompDebate --> CompRound0[Round 0: Opening Arguments<br/>3 agents propose independently<br/>Analytical, Critical, Domain-Expert]
    
    CompRound0 --> CompOverlap{Overlap ><br/>convergence<br/>threshold?}
    
    CompOverlap -->|No| CompRounds[Rounds 1-N: Rebuttals<br/>Evidence-based critiques<br/>Cross-examination]
    
    CompRounds --> CompMaxCheck{Max rounds<br/>reached?}
    
    CompMaxCheck -->|No| CompOverlap
    CompMaxCheck -->|Yes| CompJudge[Judge Agent Synthesis<br/>Consensus determination<br/>Contested items flagged]
    CompOverlap -->|Yes| CompJudge
    
    CompJudge --> CompTranscript[Save Debate Transcript<br/>JSON + TXT with timestamps]
    CompTranscript --> Stage2
    
    Stage2{Stage 2:<br/>Materials Identification} --> MatLoop[For each validated component]
    
    MatLoop --> MatAgent[Materials Extraction Agent<br/>Ontology-embedded prompting<br/>Returns MaterialsList]
    
    MatAgent --> MatFilter[Ontology Enforcement Filter<br/>Validate against HS codes<br/>Remove non-ontology materials]
    
    MatFilter --> MatFilterCheck{> 30%<br/>filtered?}
    
    MatFilterCheck -->|Yes or<br/>ENABLE_MATERIAL_DEBATE=true| MatDebate[Material Debate Protocol]
    MatFilterCheck -->|No| MatNext{More<br/>components?}
    
    MatDebate --> MatRound0[Round 0: Opening Arguments<br/>3 agents propose materials<br/>Chemistry/physics reasoning]
    
    MatRound0 --> MatOverlap{Overlap ><br/>convergence<br/>threshold?}
    
    MatOverlap -->|No| MatRounds[Rounds 1-N: Rebuttals<br/>Material essentiality probing<br/>Alternative formulations]
    
    MatRounds --> MatMaxCheck{Max rounds<br/>reached?}
    
    MatMaxCheck -->|No| MatOverlap
    MatMaxCheck -->|Yes| MatJudge[Judge Agent Synthesis<br/>Material relevance assessment<br/>Confidence scoring]
    MatOverlap -->|Yes| MatJudge
    
    MatJudge --> MatTranscript[Save Debate Transcript<br/>Material-level reasoning]
    MatTranscript --> MatNext
    
    MatNext -->|Yes| MatLoop
    MatNext -->|No| Stage3
    
    Stage3{Stage 3:<br/>Country Production Data} --> CountryLoop[For each validated material]
    
    CountryLoop --> USGSQuery[Query USGS Repository<br/>DuckDB database lookup<br/>Years 2022-2025]
    
    USGSQuery --> USGSFound{Material in<br/>USGS DB?}
    
    USGSFound -->|Yes| USGSData[Extract Top N Countries<br/>Production percentages<br/>Confidence = 1.0<br/>Source = USGS]
    
    USGSFound -->|No| CountryAgent[Country Data Extraction Agent<br/>LLM fallback estimation<br/>Returns CountryProductionList]
    
    CountryAgent --> CountryDebateCheck{ENABLE_COUNTRY_DEBATE<br/>= true?}
    
    CountryDebateCheck -->|Yes| CountryDebate[Country Data Debate Protocol<br/>MCP tool cross-reference<br/>Trade data validation]
    CountryDebateCheck -->|No| CountryTag[Tag with Source = LLM<br/>Lower confidence scores]
    
    CountryDebate --> CountryJudge[Judge Agent Assessment<br/>Trade pattern consistency<br/>Contested flags]
    
    CountryJudge --> CountryTag
    USGSData --> CountryNext{More<br/>materials?}
    CountryTag --> CountryNext
    
    CountryNext -->|Yes| CountryLoop
    CountryNext -->|No| Assemble
    
    Assemble[Assemble STDN Outputs] --> JSONOut[Write Hierarchical JSON<br/>Technology → Components<br/>→ Materials → Countries]
    
    JSONOut --> CSVOut[Write Denormalized CSV<br/>One row per material-country pair<br/>All confidence scores + provenance]
    
    CSVOut --> QualityReport[Generate Quality Report<br/>Confidence distributions<br/>Contested items<br/>USGS vs LLM ratios<br/>Runtime statistics]
    
    QualityReport --> CheckpointCheck{More<br/>technologies?}
    
    CheckpointCheck -->|Yes| CheckpointSave{Checkpoint<br/>interval<br/>reached?}
    CheckpointSave -->|Yes| SaveCheckpoint[Serialize Intermediate State<br/>Completed technologies<br/>Debate outcomes<br/>Timing stats]
    SaveCheckpoint --> Stage1
    CheckpointSave -->|No| Stage1
    
    CheckpointCheck -->|No| End([Pipeline Complete<br/>All outputs saved])
    
    style Stage1 fill:#e1f5ff
    style Stage2 fill:#fff4e1
    style Stage3 fill:#e8f5e9
    style CompDebate fill:#ffe1e1
    style MatDebate fill:#ffe1e1
    style CountryDebate fill:#ffe1e1
    style End fill:#f3e5f5
